      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A tiny, lightning\u2011fast blob that darts along the path with surprising
    speed. Its slim, fragile body can barely withstand a single hit, making it weaker
    than most other slymes. Dangerous only in groups, it relies on numbers and momentum
    rather than strength."
